    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within the highly regarded Old Quarter development, this beautifully maintained two-bedroom first floor apartment offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a spacious and stylish home in one of Ballincollig's most convenient and sought-after residential locations. Extending to approximately 76 sq.m. (818 sq.ft.), this bright and well-proportioned apartment was constructed in 2006 and has been carefully maintained by its current owners. The accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises an inviting entrance hall, a generous open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, two spacious double bedrooms, one with en-suite, and a main family bathroom. The apartment enjoys an abundance of natural light throughout and offers comfortable, modern living in a mature and well-established development. The location is second to none, with shops, cafés, \r\nrestaurants, schools, supermarkets and public transport all within easy walking distance. The nearby South Link Road Network provides quick and convenient access to Cork City Centre, Cork University Hospital, University College Cork and Cork Airport. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey apartment in a fantastic location and early \r\nviewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (L-Shaped)\r\n4.53 m x 2.08m \r\nBright and welcoming entrance hall, timber floor flows throughout to the living room. Benefitting from a storage closet. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Area\r\n4.03m x 2.65m \r\nTimber floor flows throughout the entire room, the living room benefits from a bay window and gas fire insert. Fully fitted kitchen with both floor and eye level units, benefits from electric integrated hob and oven, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.28m x 3.33m\r\nSpacious double bedroom benefits from built in wardrobes and fitted carpet. \r\nEnsuite: Comprises of three-piece shower cubicle suite with pump shower. The room is fully tiled. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.82m x 2.67m\r\nDouble bedroom, finished with built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.62m x 1.90m\r\nFully tiled bathroom, comprising of three-piece suite with a bathtub and pump shower."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stylish two bedroom apartment in the populare Old Quarter\r\nBright open plan kitchen, living and dining area\r\nAllocated parking and separate storage shed\r\nWalking distance to shops, schools and amenities\r\nEasy access to Cork city and south link road\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nManagement Fees €1346.63 per annum"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
